==Rolling Stock==
* [[Okami Metro 70 series|70 series]] (4-car sets):
*: Introduced in 1990 for the opening of the line. These trains utilize linear induction motors, allowing for a low-floor profile and the ability to negotiate the line's steep gradients and tight curves. They are instantly recognizable by their lime green livery and compact size.
* [[Okami Metro 80 series|80 series]] (4-car sets):
*: Introduced later to increase capacity. While mechanically similar to the 70 series, they feature a more modern, angular front design and updated interior LCD displays.

